git-svn-id: https://svn.apache.org/repos/asf/hadoop/common/trunk@1376543 13f79535-47bb-0310-9956-ffa450edef68

Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by the configuration system leaking class-loaders due to the way class references were cached. The original implementation stored strong references to class objects in a map, preventing the garbage collector from reclaiming memory when those classes were no longer needed, leading to potential memory leaks.

Here is the patch:
